やかし100万円飲み会、最初の酒は「零響 -Absolute 0-」。
#Yakami 1-Million-Yen Drinking Party, the first sake is 'Reikyo -Absolute 0-'.

215
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:10,980
精米歩合50%以下の日本酒は、まず何と呼ばれるかご存知ですか？
Do you know what sake with a rice milling ratio of 50% or less is called?

216
00:16:11,260 --> 00:16:12,210
え？なんて呼ばれるんですか？
Huh? What is it called?

217
00:16:12,810 --> 00:16:16,500
大吟…大吟醸！あ、大吟醸！
Dai... Daiginjo! Ah, Daiginjo!

218
00:16:16,970 --> 00:16:22,450
大吟醸！そう！と、呼ばれ、あの高級酒に位置づけられるんですよ。
Daiginjo! Exactly! It's called that, and it's classified as a high-end sake.

219
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:27,024
なんとこの零響、精米歩合が0.85%！
And this Reikyo has a rice milling ratio of 0.85%!

220
00:16:27,224 --> 00:16:31,010
え、そう！どこ！？ほぼない！！ほぼ削っちゃった！
Eh, really?! Where?! Almost none!! You shaved almost all of it!

221
00:16:31,940 --> 00:16:35,824
お米全体のあの99.15%を削って、
Shaving off 99.15% of the entire rice grain,

222
00:16:35,924 --> 00:16:42,530
残り0.85%の部分だけを使って、極限まで削られた部分だけで…
and using only the remaining 0.85%, using only the part that has been shaved to the absolute limit...

223
00:16:43,370 --> 00:16:44,780
スゲェー！
That's amazing!

224
00:16:45,340 --> 00:16:50,024
お米の真ん中の真ん中の真ん中の真ん中…見えな～い！
The very center of the center of the center of the rice... Can't see it~!

225
00:16:50,124 --> 00:16:52,010
そうですね！
That's right!

226
00:16:52,710 --> 00:16:59,100
なんとあの5297時間、221日もの時間をかけて精米…
It takes 5,297 hours, 221 days to mill...

227
00:16:59,660 --> 00:17:02,920
じっくりとお酒を、あの、お米をね、磨くそうですよ。
They slowly polish the rice for the sake.

228
00:17:03,100 --> 00:17:04,940
