249
00:18:30,790 --> 00:18:32,510
雑みのないっ！
Completely free of off-flavors!

250
00:18:33,450 --> 00:18:37,024
この、0.8だっけ、さっきの、0.85！0.85！
This, was it 0.8 earlier? 0.85! 0.85!

251
00:18:37,024 --> 00:18:40,350
雑みがなくてスッキリとしてるっ！
It has no off-flavors and is crisp and clean!

252
